A||||5||My7Fieros||Just bought a mint Fiero!! And it caught on FIRE!!!||||11||
Z||000000||My7Fieros||11-11-2000||03:34 PM||||Ok relax...heres the deal. Yesterday my roommate just bought a MINT 86 Gt. Its white/grey, 5 speed..loaded....61K miles!!! Well, we went to take it for a spin last night..we were driving down the street and I asked him to pull over into this gas station so that I could get something to drink. Well, we did. We get out of the car, and we each looked at each other....HEY I SMELL SOMETHING BURNING! We both said at the same time. He popped the decklid...FLAMES!!! Oh Sh1t!!! HOWEVER, it was a HUGE piles of leaves that were sitting on the exhaust manifold...I ran inside, grabbed a bottle of bottled water, and ran out and hosed the engine down. PHEW! Thank God it was only leaves! No damage was done. We went to a do it yourself car wash and cleaned the engine nicely...no sign of damage! <BR>I'll post pics of the car soon (gotta find my dig. camera). Now I guess I can say I (kinda) got the perverbial "fiero fire" over with!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||11
Z||000001||88formula||11-11-2000||03:50 PM||||You had me going! I hate that word "fire".||||reg||1
